 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2492  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2492) 'This RFD is written so that a session with no memory of the work can begin from it. Read these
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2492  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2492) 'in order before writing anything.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2492  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2492) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2492  1 LINE
 Text:Written

